            "review_title": "Review at Lotus Blanc Cafe Restaurant",
            "review_text": "TTSL\nSingapore, Singapore1 contribution\n0\nWaste of calories\nDec 2019 • Couples\nOur intention was to eat at the pho shop opposite, but ended up here because the queue was too long and we didn't have the luxury of time. \n\nOrdered a vegetarian spring roll and 2 spicy beef noodles - we ate a few mouths and gave up. The spring rolls were soaked in oil and not tasty (to us at least), compared the the spring rolls we have been eating the past few days. The beef noodles had pork slices too. The soup tasted like diluted tomyum paste, the noodle soup tasted like they were from a packet of instant noodles. The meat was like leather and had a very strong pork taste. \n\nThe iced coconut coffee was alright.\nWill not suggest anyone to eat here even if desperate. Guess it's alright if it's just a drink.\nRead more\nWritten December 16, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
