            "review_title": "Review at Lotus Blanc Cafe Restaurant",
            "review_text": "traverseinfinity\n107 contributions\n0\nDelicious food and good service\nAug 2019 • Couples\nWe stumbled upon this restaurant after walking around for a bit with very hungry tummies! The place is air conditioned which is a plus and the staff were attentive. We had the sweet and sour pork and local steak with green pepper sauce and two beers. The food was absolutely great. Not greasy and like a really really good takeaway back home in the UK. My husband decided to have apple pie for dessert which he said was delicious and then we had cocktails which were probably the highlight of the evening. My passionfruit margarita had a salted rim and the taste was sublime! Would definitely go back here. Only complaint might be that the portions are a bit small- I could have eaten more!\nRead more\nWritten August 3, 2019",
            "rating": 4.0,
