            "review_text": "Jamsoncoke\nMelbourne, Australia27 contributions\n0\nGive this place a go, had good meals & service.\nApr 2019 • Solo\nI ate here twice in a few day, Vietnamese food both times. Sat on outside table each visit. The beer was cold, the food tastey & no fault with the service staff.\n\nTried both the beef & chicken pho & both were good, asked for chilli & very promptly received a fresh cut chilli & pepper. Also had crab spiring rolls & a salad which were also nice. Food was quite cheap & good value for money.\n\nService was unobtrusive but prompt, all you have to do is catch their eye & they are right to you. Signal the staff for a beer or the bill and they are onto it straight away.\n\nMany Asian restaurants don't clear the table until you leave, but just ask and they will.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 1, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
